# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/*.tfstate.backup
**/*.tfstate.backup.*
**/*.tfplan
**/*.tfplan.*
**/*.tfvars
!**/terraform.tfvars.example
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/crash.log
**/crash.*.log
**/*.tf.json
**/*.tf.json.*
**/.terraformrc
**/terraform.rc

# Environment specific
**/env.tfvars
**/secrets.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars
!**/terraform.tfvars

# AWS
**/.aws/
**/credentials

# Docker
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose.override.yml

# IDE
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store

# OS
**/Thumbs.db
**/.DS_Store

# Terraform-docs
**/.terraform-docs.yml

# Terragrunt
**/.terragrunt-cache/
**/terragrunt.hcl

# Secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.cert
**/*.p12
